      ],
      "message": "wallet: reject unknown options in sendall\n\nUnknown options were silently ignored, so a typo such as \"input\" for\n\"inputs\" spent all available UTXOs rather than the given ones. The\noptions are checked before the fee arguments are merged into them, so\nthat a misspelled estimate_mode is reported as an unexpected key.",
